            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## WaveVoice 1.0

The first stable release of WaveVoice: dictation in any app, voice notes and meetings, on your Mac.

- **New:** Add your own sounds. In Insertion & Alerts, choose "Add Sound…" and use it when starting, stopping, inserting or on errors (up to 10 seconds).
- **Improved:** An active license stands out more: a green badge in Home and a green check in License.
- **Improved:** With your license activated, the WaveVoice icon gets a special finish in Home and License.
]]></description>
